The core approach can be simplified into four areas:

### 🏠 1. Fixed Costs
Essential and regular expenses.

### 🎯 2. Investments
Money allocated toward long-term growth.

### 💰 3. Savings Goals
Money for specific future purposes.

### 🎉 4. Guilt-Free Spending
Money you intentionally spend and enjoy.

